\newlabel{fig:sd}{{2}{7}{Batch-mode backpropagation with line minimization. Dashed contours pass through $\mathbf w(0)$, $\mathbf w(1)$ and $\mathbf w(2)$. Red arrows show $\nabla E$ and blue arrows show $\mathbf h=-\nabla E$ (directions only, not to scale). Panel (b) enlarges the region around $\mathbf w^*$ to show epoch 2}{figure.caption.16}{}}
