\newlabel{fig:cg}{{3}{9}{Conjugate gradient training with line minimization. Epoch 1 is identical to part (a). In epoch 2, the dashed red arrow is the negative gradient, the grey arrow is $\gamma \mathbf h_0$ (vectors scaled for visibility), and their sum $\mathbf h_1$ leads directly to the minimum, so $E=0$ after two epochs}{figure.caption.19}{}}
